{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荃灣有人猝死。昨日（16日）下午4時許，一名41歲女子在河背街46號住所睡房暈倒，丈夫見狀報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，女事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，女事主來自印尼，持有本港身份證。</p><figure><img alt=\"女事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1187926729713258496721594.jpeg/wHey6qVBuXlcqI7qeVkORA8JX1pShtIQglB-EbhQfhE\"/><figcaption>女事主昏迷被送往仁濟醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T17:01:16.595515+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:43:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T22:37:46.233681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:57:43.681323+00:00","content_hash":"a8f3a756e905eb7bd27a511b68ffd766f75a5583e0639ec778b48f5ac873f117","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}